      "title": "HOW TO USE EXTRA PICTURES — 3 to 16",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.45.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The MiniMax H3 conditioning node already exposes up to 16 picture inputs.\n\nDefault tested mapping in this workflow:\n- Picture 1 = main target\n- Picture 2 = main donor / reference\n\nAdditional pictures:\n- Picture 3 to Picture 16 can be connected manually by adding more Load Image nodes and plugging them into the corresponding H3 inputs.\n- They are NOT required for the current tested prompts.\n- They become useful only if you intentionally edit the prompt to refer to them.\n\nRecommendation:\n- Keep only the references that are actually useful.\n- More references can increase VRAM/RAM use and may reduce clarity if the prompt does not define each image role clearly."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "The MiniMax H3 conditioning node already exposes up to 16 picture inputs.\n\nDefault tested mapping in this workflow:\n- Picture 1 = main target\n- Picture 2 = main donor / reference\n\nAdditional pictures:\n- Picture 3 to Picture 16 can be connected manually by adding more Load Image nodes and plugging them into the corresponding H3 inputs.\n- They are NOT required for the current tested prompts.\n- They become useful only if you intentionally edit the prompt to refer to them.\n\nRecommendation:\n- Keep only the references that are actually useful.\n- More references can increase VRAM/RAM use and may reduce clarity if the prompt does not define each image role clearly."
      },
      "color": "#334",
      "bgcolor": "#556"
